---
title: RewardRedemption State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : Retailer submits redemption (points held)
    Pending --> Approved : Admin approves request
    Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects (held points released)
    Approved --> Delivered : reward handed over / shipped
    Approved --> Rejected : rejected after approval (held points released)
    Delivered --> Completed : fulfilment confirmed (held -> lifetime redeemed)
    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
